ear and Aromatic Alkynes.&#x201d; Applied and Environmental Microbiology 86: e02388&#x2010;02319.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC7170481</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">32086308</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>

