Wunderer, M.
, Markt R., Lackner N., and Wagner A. O.. 2022. &#x201c;The Glutamyl Tail Length of the Cofactor F420 in the Methanogenic Archaea Methanosarcina Thermophila and <i>Methanoculleus thermophilus</i>
